<section class="container">
    <h2>How it works?</h2>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="content">
            <img src="/src/assets/discovery.jpg" class="photo" alt="discovery">
            <h3>Step 1 - Discovery</h3>
            <p>You contact us with you idea or problem. We define goals, features, timeline and budget.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <img src="/src/assets/development.jpg" class="photo" alt="development">
            <h3>Step 2 - Development</h3>
            <p>We develope clean, fast and scalable code with a strong focus on performance and UX.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <img src="/src/assets/delivery.jpg" class="photo" alt="delivery">
            <h3>Step 3 - Delivery</h3>
            <p>The project is delivered, optimized and ready to use. Ongoing support and maintenance available if needed.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<style lang="scss">
    .wrapper {
        display: flex;
        gap: 50px;
        justify-content: center;
    }
    .content {
        padding: 20px;
        max-width: min-content;
        flex: 1;
    }
    .photo{
        max-width: 200px;
    }
    h3,h2,p{
        text-align: center;
    }
    h2 {
        font-size: 48px;
    }
    @media only screen and (max-width: 768px) {
        .wrapper {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0px;
        }

        .container {
        padding-left: 10px;
        padding-right: 10px;
        }

        h2{
            font-size: 38px;
        }
    }

</style>